node_modules/
dist/
.DS_Store
*.log
.env

# Only lab-related files ship in this repo (board directive 2026-11-09): internal
# build briefs and queue notes (GOAL.md, RESUME.md) live in the Paperclip BMC-1
# plan document, never here.
GOAL.md
RESUME.md

# no images/scans in this tree while manual scans sit nearby (License Counsel, BMC-3):
# the site is pure canvas/SVG; re-add specific asset types deliberately when an
# image lab actually ships with a cleared licence.
#
# Narrow exception, board-approved 2026-11-08 (BMC-15): Lab 14's ten Commons
# galaxy photos in site/img/ ONLY (licences per file in ATTRIBUTION.md).
# Everywhere else the refusal below stays total - do not widen this.
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.webp
*.bmp
*.tif
*.tiff
*.pdf
*.heic

# Archives: refuse every zip by default; the one committed binary is the generated
# offline-kit bundle (site/offline/kit.zip) and nothing else (BMC-19 / GitHub #16).
*.zip
!site/offline/
!site/offline/kit.zip

!site/img/
!site/img/*.jpg
